 The paper is structured as follows.
In Section  2 , we first present the problem to be addressed in a formal way. In Section  3 , we review the concept of subresultant for multiple polynomials and its equivalent form in roots.
In Section  4 , we present the main result of the paper (Theorem  16 ), which is followed by a detailed proof in Section  5 .
In Section  6 , we design an algorithm for solving the proposed problem with the newly developed tool.
In Section  7 , we compare the performance of the algorithm and the size of polynomials output by the algorithm and those
given by previous works.
