 varying-field convexity including the pole and vertical dependence, smooth Mellin decay with support crossing coordinate axes, residue and error (5)-(6), all uniformities and parameter order in A148. Check fixed-cutoff tightness, uniform finite-chart smooth majorants, open-ball Portmanteau, bounded-density invariant restrictions and all ergodic components. Check finite-scale extraction (12)-(15), Shiu and residue entrances, Q,d powers, entropy constants, the conditional probability-limit scope and invariant-lift gap. Check exact volume (16), unit proportions, residue bounds and applicability of existing equal-discriminant entropy. Check actual local joint-containment and ambient-Hecke examples, not abstract countermodels. Check primary comparison by operative hypotheses. Original C145 is unresolved, not falsely claimed; A148 is restricted and technical. Parent response is selective. Any necessary correction must be separate and must not retroactively change the original verdict.\\n\\nTHEN PARK C145, including the remaining small-q/maximal-order branch, and search fresh substantial deductions from the following distinct algorithmic families. These are screening directions, not assertions of a gap. Read full stronges"}, {"path": "frontier/sources/i148_polynomial_index_torus_subpackets/snapshots/frontier/iterations/iteration145-arithmetic-automorphic-discovery-task.json", "line": 3, "text": "  \"brief\": \"I145 \u2014 Original I142 audit and fresh arithmetic/automorphic discovery.\\nWork in /home/mj-kang/Documents/Dev/math/openai-proof-research. Read AGENTS.md, immutable upstream and current ledgers. Eight accepted substantial findings, two remain. User authorizes T3 subagents and stipulates ALL OpenAI theorems AND lower operations at fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb. No upstream truth audit, source contradiction inference or ex-falso. External literature is ordinary evidence. No children, shared edits, staging, commits or publication. Own ONLY frontier/iterations/i145-arithmetic-automorphic-discovery.md, frontier/sources/i145_arithmetic_automorphic_discovery/, frontier/experiments/i145_arithmetic_automorphic_discovery/. Do not bind active I143/I144 outputs or unrelated projects.\\n\\nFIRST independently audit ORIGINAL I142 paid assertions without repairs, reporting PASS without repairs / FAIL / unresolved separately. U142: exact greedy bin bound and n! cube rounding, geometric-series charge over all levels, common dyadic supply and actual terminating packing, interior-grid containment and every constant in U, zeta strictness and local entrance, standard cube triangulation/unimodular maps, local mixed interpolation/backward transfer, permutation-chamber determinant signs, hierarchical finite gluing and distinct centres, original graded saturation and compact margins, all-large-degree assertion, real vectors/common locus, fixed-slack uniformity, asymptotic exponents and shrinkage, and precise failure of its own bound at a fixed boundary vector. V142: q/eta uniform entrance, continuous unequal bubble inputs, fixed-X normal-cone transfer and real/countable scopes, genuine improvement beyond each separate old supply, exact definition of G, full-volume equality cases, uniform capacity factor bound, suppression of unary loss, finite-tree repetition, telescoping local/omitted/downward losses, retained-path depth and finite pruned subsequence, limits of equal/envelope primitives with omitted children, deepest-node repetition, strict-convex supporting-functional reduction, pushing internal convexification/limits/deletion through finite refinements, and the diffuse distinct profile. The obstruction is only to the defined combined primitive grammar; it does not include arbitrary unspecified nef bubbles, all source operations, or necessarily U142. No non-nef example is supplied. Preserve original A139/B139 scopes and original I133 literal I.5 FAIL separately"}, {"path": "frontier/sources/i143_weighted_boundary_pole_control/context/i